          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baawe ku barihurura nibaza aha rugamba kurwana n'abazigu baabo, omu muhanda gwona ogu oribatoozamu, baakushaba nibareeba ei oru rurembo oru waatooraine ruri, n'egi nju ei nyombekyeire eiziina ryawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
